<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian palm oil seen extending losses.</title>
<headline>Malaysian palm oil seen extending losses.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palm oil prices in Malaysia were expected to extend losses on Thursday due to aggressive selling by a major refiner in the cash market and overnight fall in Chicago soyoil futures, traders said.</p>
<p>* July resistance pegged at 1,280 ringgit</p>
<p>* July support - 1,260 ringgit</p>
<p>* July closed on Tuesday at 1,270 ringgit a tonne</p>
</text>
